-- THE TRAMPOLINE ORACLE (frozen at trampoline-freeze-r0; red by
-- design until the trampoline implementation lands — the
-- increment-protocol form, the exact/dyadic precedent above; stanza
-- bytes from test-trampoline/stanza.cabal.draft).

test-suite trampoline
